## Purpose
Ensure that at least **two** Organisation Owners can fully disable GitHub Copilot for all members within **15 minutes** of a trigger event, and that the disable path is tested and documented.

---

## Authorised Admin Roles

### Who Can Disable Copilot
Only **GitHub Organisation Owners** can disable Copilot org-wide. There must be a minimum of **two** Owner accounts at all times for redundancy.

