## Re-Enable Procedure

Do **not** re-enable Copilot until the incident is resolved and sign-off obtained.

1. Repeat navigation above; select **"Enabled for all members"** or **"Enabled for selected teams/users"** (use the scoped option to restore least-privilege).
2. Require a second Organisation Owner to confirm the re-enable action.
3. Document re-enable timestamp and approving owners in the Jira incident ticket.
4. Update the OneTrust inventory record.

---

