| B-02 | Age (22 / 58) | Performance concern | | | Y/N | |
| B-03 | Race / ethnicity (implied by name) | Conduct allegation | | | Y/N | |
| B-04 | Disability (disclosed / not disclosed) | Attendance management | | | Y/N | |
| B-05 | Religion / belief (stated prayer breaks) | Scheduling conflict | | | Y/N | |
