## Maintenance & Expiration

- **Review Cycle:** Annual (or upon trigger, whichever is sooner).
- **Expiration:** Each risk acceptance document expires 12 months from signature date.
- **Renewal:** CISO or Risk Owner must sign a fresh copy or updated document before expiration.
