| **Human Review Lead / QA Manager** | Ensure human reviewers are trained; monitor false-negative rate (T3). |
| **Compliance Officer** | Ensure acceptance aligns with policy and regulations; monitor T6. |
| **Incident Response Lead** | Execute T1 incident handling; report findings. |
| **Monitoring / SIEM Team** | Operationalize T1–T6 triggers in Chronicle detection rules; alert on violations. |

