# Control: 69d47a33-57ce-4829-bddd-76b6b6e2733e — Pydantic schema validation of extracted contract terms in LangChain.
# SCAFFOLD: review before applying. This script scaffolds the Python module and
# wires it into the LangGraph graph; adapt paths and field definitions to your codebase.

