ng with conditional edges enforcing sequence; no parallel execution paths between Okta provisioning and email sending.', 'Modify a test run to attempt email sending before Okta provisioning completes and confirm the graph rejects the transition; verify the graph''s compiled state machine matches the approved sequence.', 'not_checked', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'config', 'bash', 'langgraph_pipeline_execution_order.sh', '# Control: bd2d84a6-c90c-4a3e-b31a-cfc8fe2830a9 — LangGraph execution-order enforcement scaffold
