- **Confluence:** [TODO: Link to responsibility page URL]
- **Control Ref:** `4498977e-32af-4cb2-85a7-fe24afbf8bd7`
', '2026-06-20T01:47:54.729+00:00', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO control_items ("id", "org_id", "use_case_id", "pillar", "control", "why", "requirement", "status", "owner", "created_at", "framework_refs", "stack_implementation", "evidence", "assurance_test", "verification_status", "verification_mode", "verification_note", "verified_by", "verified_at", "artifact_type", "artifact_language", "artifact_filename", "artifact_content", "artifact_generated_at", "capability_id", "evidence_url") VALUES ('0b24bfe6-67a2-4a92-802c-b84d55850171', '00000000-0000-4000-a000-0000000000de', '84c9d8a0-f0da-43ca-8e3a-41c529bfbe9d', 2, 'Enforce employee identity propagation from Slack/Teams through to the retrieval layer so that every query is associated with a verified Okta identity and the retrieval layer can evaluate per-document access controls against that identity.', 'The client claims retrieval-layer access controls exist, but without identity propagation from the chat interface to the vector database query, access controls cannot be enforced — the shadow access path bypasses existing document permissions.', 'required', 'gap', NULL, '2026-06-09T03:25:55.430552+00:00', '{"eu_ai_act":"Art. 10 (data governance); Art. 15 (accuracy, robustness, cybersecurity)","iso_42001":"A.6.2.4; A.8.2","owasp_llm":"LLM06 Excessive Agency","nist_ai_rmf":"GOVERN 1.7; MAP 5.1"}'::jsonb, 'In the LangChain retrieval chain, extract the authenticated user identity from the Slack/Teams bot event payload (which should be linked to Okta SSO via the workspace''s SAML integration). Pass the Okta user ID or group memberships as a metadata filter parameter to the vector database similarity search call. In the vector database, ensure each ingested chunk carries an ACL metadata field (e.g., allowed_groups) populated at ingestion time. Configure the retrieval query to include a filter: `{''allowed_groups'': {''$in'': user_groups}}`.', 'LangChain chain configuration showing Okta token or user ID extraction from Slack/Teams integration, passed as metadata to the vector database query filter.', 'Submit identical queries from two employees with different document permission levels and confirm the retrieval results differ according to their access rights — the restricted employee must not receive chunks from documents they cannot access in the source system.', 'not_checked', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
