itation and no-source fallback behavior; sample outputs showing citations.', 'Submit a query on a topic not in the corpus and confirm the bot returns the no-information fallback message instead of a fabricated answer; submit a query on a known topic and confirm the response includes a specific document source reference.', 'not_checked', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'config', 'bash', 'langchain_source_attribution_config.sh', '#!/bin/bash
