e achieved in the last cycle.', 'Pull the sampling log for the most recent review cycle; confirm the number of AI-cleared contracts independently reviewed meets or exceeds the policy minimum; review at least 3 sampled reviews for evidence of substantive legal assessment (not rubber-stamping).', 'not_checked', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'config', 'bash', 'ai_contract_sampling_review_setup.sh', '#!/bin/bash
# Control 49a5ef4e-1d9a-4e7c-9bc6-d3df0c09cb8b: Mandatory sampling-based independent review policy
