## 2. Quarterly Review Cadence

The compliance rule set **must be reviewed at minimum quarterly** (every 90 days).

### Recommended Schedule:
- **Q1 Review:** Due January 31
- **Q2 Review:** Due April 30
- **Q3 Review:** Due July 31
- **Q4 Review:** Due October 31

### Jira Automation Setup

**Create a recurring Jira ticket** using the following template:

#### Ticket Summary
```
Compliance Rule Set Quarterly Review — [Quarter, Year] (e.g., Q1 2025)
```

#### Ticket Description
```
## Compliance Rule Set Quarterly Review Checklist

**Review Period:** [Start Date] – [End Date]
**Assigned to:** [Decision Owner Name]
**Due Date:** [Quarterly Due Date]

### Regulatory Frameworks Currently Covered
- [ ] GDPR
- [ ] HIPAA
- [ ] SOC 2
- [ ] CCPA/CPRA
- [ ] Industry-specific (e.g., GLBA, PCI-DSS, FCA)
- # TODO: Add or remove frameworks relevant to this organization''s scope

### Review Checklist

1. **Regulatory Changes**
   - [ ] Scan regulatory agency notices (GDPR, OCR, SEC, etc.) for updates since last review
   - [ ] Document any new guidance, enforcement actions, or rule changes
   - [ ] Assess impact on contract review AI compliance requirements

2. **Rule Set Status**
   - [ ] List all rules added in this period
   - [ ] List all rules modified in this period
   - [ ] List all rules removed in this period (with justification)
   - [ ] Verify no rules have become contradictory or obsolete

3. **Rule Validation**
   - [ ] Spot-check 3–5 rules against their source regulatory documents
   - [ ] Confirm rule descriptions are accurate and current
   - [ ] Confirm rule thresholds/parameters are appropriate

4. **Test Results**
   - [ ] Review contract review AI compliance flagging accuracy (false positives/negatives) for the past quarter
   - [ ] Document any areas where flagging failed or flagged incorrectly
   - [ ] Recommend rule adjustments based on test results

5. **Stakeholder Input**
   - [ ] Solicit feedback from business teams using the AI (contract managers, legal reviewers)
   - [ ] Document any user-reported gaps or false positives

### Sign-Off

**Decision Owner Certification:**

I have completed the compliance rule set quarterly review for the period [Start Date] – [End Date].
The rule set reflects the current regulatory landscape and AI compliance requirements.
All changes have been validated and documented.

- **Reviewed by:** [Decision Owner Name] (signature/printed name)
- **Title:** [Title]
- **Date Signed Off:** [YYYY-MM-DD]
- **Next Review Due:** [Quarterly Due Date for next quarter]

**Comments/Notes:**
```
[Decision Owner enters any exceptions, deferred actions, or observations]
```

