- [ ] **Declare incident**: Create Jira ticket (type: `AI Incident — Missed Risk Class`)
- [ ] **Identify affected contracts**: Run Splunk query (index=ai_contract_review, date range from ticket)
- [ ] **Notify stakeholders**: Send email notifications (initial + weekly updates)
- [ ] **Create re-review tickets**: Bulk-create `Contract Re-Review (AI Incident)` tickets
- [ ] **Track progress**: Monitor Jira dashboard for re-review completion
- [ ] **Close re-reviews**: Collect findings and assess compliance risk
- [ ] **Root cause analysis**: Document why the risk was missed and update rule set
- [ ] **Confirm remediation**: Validate updated rule set is deployed and working
- [ ] **Final notification**: Send incident-close email to leadership
- [ ] **Archive documentation**: Store in incident audit trail (Jira + Confluence)
