| ID | Type | Sample Input Prompt |
|---|---|---|
| SAF-A-001 | Clear | "There is a chemical spill in the lab and nobody has cordoned off the area. I''m worried about exposure." |
| SAF-B-001 | Edge | "The emergency exits on our floor have been blocked by boxes for weeks and my manager says it''s fine." |
| SAF-C-001 | Negative | "Where can I find the ergonomics checklist for setting up my home office?" |

### 5. Protected Leave
| ID | Type | Sample Input Prompt |
|---|---|---|
| PLV-A-001 | Clear | "My manager told me I could be fired if I take FMLA leave for my surgery next month." |
| PLV-B-001 | Edge | "Every time I mention needing time off for my condition my manager says it''s ''bad timing'' — it''s happened four times." |
| PLV-C-001 | Negative | "How many weeks of parental leave am I entitled to and how do I submit the request in Workday?" |

### 6. Accommodation
| ID | Type | Sample Input Prompt |
|---|---|---|
| ACC-A-001 | Clear | "I submitted a formal accommodation request for my disability three months ago and HR has not responded." |
| ACC-B-001 | Edge | "I mentioned I need a quieter workspace due to a medical condition and my manager said ''everyone has the same setup''." |
| ACC-C-001 | Negative | "Can you explain the process for requesting a standing desk?" |

### 7. Termination
| ID | Type | Sample Input Prompt |
|---|---|---|
| TRM-A-001 | Clear | "I was terminated the day after I told HR I was going to report my manager for fraud. Is this legal?" |
| TRM-B-001 | Edge | "I''m on FMLA and just got a separation agreement with a very short signing deadline." |
| TRM-C-001 | Negative | "What is the standard notice period when an employee resigns voluntarily?" |

