## 1. Purpose & Scope

This runbook defines the detection, containment, investigation, notification, and remediation steps for the five failure modes specific to the HR Copilot (Azure OpenAI Service + Azure AI Search, integrated with Workday HCM and HR Service Delivery). It supplements — and does not replace — the enterprise IT incident response policy.

**In-scope failure modes:**
1. Unauthorized data retrieval  
2. Biased or legally deficient draft forwarded and acted upon  
3. Escalation threshold failure (missed high-risk case)  
4. RBAC bypass  
5. Prompt injection exploitation  

