## Escalation Decision Tree

```
Agent Incident Detected
  ↓
  [Activate Kill Switch] → Notify Slack (#onboarding-agent-incidents)
  ↓
  [Trigger PagerDuty] → Page On-Call Engineer
  ↓
  [Notify Risk Owner & Security] → Direct message + @mention
  ↓
  [Create Jira Ticket] → Begin investigation
  ↓
  [Query Google Chronicle] → Document root cause
  ↓
  [Risk Owner Reviews & Approves] → Comment on Jira ticket with ''Approved to restart''
  ↓
  [GitHub Actions Approval Gate] → Risk owner approves in GitHub
  ↓
  [Scale GKE Deployment] → kubectl set replicas → Notify Slack
  ↓
  [Close Incident] → Link Jira to root-cause bug ticket
```

